        "body": "orders-demo 的订单 API 最近返回 401，请核实当前绑定路由的真实响应和原因。",
        "body_digest": "73178e766a16eabe950c031977b7c9ec3e913fb14573453999cf3bcfc627a455",
        "created_at": "2026-10-22T17:05:34.686+00:00",
